sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Caller as Patient / Caller
    participant Interface as Voice / Chat Client
    participant Agent as AI Agent Orchestrator
    participant RAG as RAG Service (services/rag)
    participant Store as Vector Knowledge Store

    Caller->>Interface: "What is your appointment cancellation policy?"
    Interface->>Agent: Text Query: "What is your appointment cancellation policy?"

    Note over Agent: Intent: INFORMATIONAL_FAQ<br/>No database mutation required.<br/>Route to Knowledge Base.

    Agent->>RAG: POST /api/v1/rag/retrieve {query: "cancellation policy", top_k: 2}
    
    RAG->>RAG: Compute Query Embedding Vector
    RAG->>Store: Semantic Similarity Search (Cosine distance against doc embeddings)
    Store-->>RAG: Retrieved Chunks: [Doc: "clinic_policies.pdf", chunk_03, score: 0.89]
    
    RAG-->>Agent: HTTP 200 OK {retrieved_chunks: [...], context_summary: "Free cancellation up to 4 hours prior"}

    Note over Agent: Inject grounded text into LLM prompt.<br/>Synthesize factual answer without hallucination.

    Agent->>Interface: "Our policy allows free cancellation up to 4 hours prior to your scheduled visit."
    Interface-->>Caller: Display / Speak Grounded Response
